# Credentials — never commit. The push adapters read APNs `.p8` and FCM
# service-account JSON via the CLI's `tenants set-push` command, which
# wraps the file with AES-256-GCM and stores the ciphertext in SQLite.
# The plaintext files should stay on the operator's workstation only.
*.p8
*.pem
*-service-account.json
service-account*.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
